 63388                           ;	Power-up timer selection bits
 63389                           ;	PWRTS = PWRT_OFF, PWRT is disabled
 63390                           ;	Multi-vector enable bit
 63391                           ;	MVECEN = ON, Multi-vector enabled, Vector table used for interrupts
 63392                           ;	IVTLOCK bit One-way set enable bit
 63393                           ;	IVT1WAY = ON, IVTLOCKED bit can be cleared and set only once
